    <briefdescription>
<para>Black volatility curve modelled as variance curve. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class calculates time-dependent Black volatilities using as input a vector of (ATM) Black volatilities observed in the market.</para><para>The calculation is performed interpolating on the variance curve. <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_linear" kindref="compound">Linear</ref> interpolation is used as default; this can be changed by the setInterpolation() method.</para><para>For strike dependence, see <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_black_variance_surface" kindref="compound">BlackVarianceSurface</ref>.</para><para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000061"><xreftitle>Possible enhancements</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>check time extrapolation</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
